chaosshard.beast.intro=Echoes
chaosshard.beast.intro.text=Before Chaos I had acquaintances — beasts. I forgot their names, but the Thread remembers: call properly and §dechoes of old acquaintances§r come along it.\n\nOne of each. Grows with me up to §elevel 5§r, a §eperk point§r per level. Perks are taken on the beast page for Essence, reset with a World Shard.\n\nA fallen echo §dreturns to the Thread§r and comes back in 5 minutes. Level 5 needs the §dAscension§r ritual. Hover the XP bar to see how a beast grows.
