chaosshard.beast.cat.lvl.1=Raw fish, scares creepers
chaosshard.beast.cat.lvl.1.desc=When I'm hungry brings raw cod or salmon every 3 minutes. Creepers within 8 blocks back away.
chaosshard.beast.cat.lvl.2=Cooked fish
chaosshard.beast.cat.lvl.2.desc=Cooked fish every 2.5 minutes. Scares creepers within 12.
chaosshard.beast.cat.lvl.3=Fish dishes, luck, gifts
chaosshard.beast.cat.lvl.3.desc=Fish sticks and salmon onigiri every 2 minutes. Luck near her. A gift every morning.
chaosshard.beast.cat.lvl.4=Hearty dinners, senses
chaosshard.beast.cat.lvl.4.desc=Fish and chips, fish dinner every 1.5 minutes, sometimes double. Hostiles within 16 glow.
chaosshard.beast.cat.lvl.5=Chaos Catch
chaosshard.beast.cat.lvl.5.desc=Brings Chaos Catch, sometimes a golden apple — every minute. Creepers near me never explode.\n§dAscension at the Breach Altar:§7 8 Essence, 4 Veil Shards, 4 raw salmon. Thread 3.
