chaosshard.beast.cat.perk.4=Purring
chaosshard.beast.cat.perk.4.desc=Regeneration while I sleep or stand near her.
chaosshard.beast.cat.perk.5=Cat's Eye
chaosshard.beast.cat.perk.5.desc=Night vision near her.
chaosshard.beast.cat.perk.6=Vermin Hunter
chaosshard.beast.cat.perk.6.desc=Kills silverfish and endermites, hisses at witches.
chaosshard.beast.cat.perk.7=Ninth Life
chaosshard.beast.cat.perk.7.desc=Returns from the Thread in 1 minute instead of 5.
chaosshard.beast.tiger.lore=The stripes are cracks with Chaos shining through.
chaosshard.beast.tiger.xp=Tiger XP: kills (tougher foes give more), raw beef (+20 per 10 min), time nearby.
chaosshard.beast.tiger.lvl.1=Strong melee
chaosshard.beast.tiger.lvl.1.desc=Lots of health and a heavy blow. +15 health and +2 damage per level.
chaosshard.beast.tiger.lvl.2=Pounce
chaosshard.beast.tiger.lvl.2.desc=Leaps at a foe 4–12 blocks away. Every 5 s.
chaosshard.beast.tiger.lvl.3=Roar
chaosshard.beast.tiger.lvl.3.desc=Roars in combat every 20 s: hostiles within 8 are slowed and weakened.
chaosshard.beast.tiger.lvl.4=Chaos Strike
chaosshard.beast.tiger.lvl.4.desc=Every fifth hit adds armor-piercing Chaos damage.
chaosshard.beast.tiger.lvl.5=Lord of the Hunt
chaosshard.beast.tiger.lvl.5.desc=I wound a foe from afar — the Tiger appears next to it. Its kills give me energy and health. Below a third of my health it rages.\n§dAscension at the Breach Altar:§7 8 Essence, 2 dragon scales, 4 blaze rods. Thread 4.
