# Challenge
item.chaosshard.challenge_sphere.name=Sphere of Challenge
chaosshard.ritual.challenge=Challenge
chaosshard.ritual.challenge.desc=The sphere draws thoughts about me out of the noosphere - fear, hatred, thirst for vengeance, even ideas of other worlds - and opens an unstable pocket where they take shape. They come in waves; a defeated thought condenses into loot, and the Thread feeds on what I overcame.
chaosshard.ritual.challenge.more_label=→ Whose thoughts, how many, colouring and where
chaosshard.ritual.challenge.more=§lWhose thoughts§r (on top of the base):\n4 gold - Order of Light, an image of righteous punishment\nGarrot banner - dread of Garrot's host\n8 rotten flesh - the beastly terror of the wild\n4 iron - Scavengers, ideas of another world carried along the Thread\n§lHow many:§r 1-5 World Shards - a tier, 3-7 waves with a leader at the end; Nether Star - endless.\n§lColouring§r (one each, +25%% reward each): blaze powder - Fury, iron block - Temper, sugar - Relentless, ink sac - Dark, redstone - Blood Price, bone - Horde, gunpowder - Blast, spider eye - Hunter.\n§lWhere:§r near your own Anchor the pocket merges with the waking world and the thoughts come out into it. Away from it the pocket is fragile and cannot hold me - it crumbles and I wake outside.
