chaosshard.omen.silent=The Thread is silent about where %s stands. This Pillar is still hidden.
chaosshard.omen.order=First the Pillar guarded by %s. The Veil is held like a chain: links can't be skipped.
chaosshard.omen.fallen=That Pillar has already fallen: %s is dead.
chaosshard.omen.already=The Pillar is guarded by %s: §e%s %s§d (%s blocks, %s). No Omen needed — the way is known.
chaosshard.omen.nowhere=The Omen finds nothing to hold: no untouched land ahead. Try from another place.
