chaosshard.hero.kael.phase2=Captains, to me! ...Not as help. As witnesses.
chaosshard.hero.kael.death=Tell Irena... the shield... wasn't to blame...
chaosshard.hero.kael.front=His shield can't be pierced from the front. Strike from the side or back — or wait until he lowers it after a flash or a charge.
chaosshard.hero.kael.raise=Kael raises his blade — look away!
chaosshard.hero.kael.memory=The Pillar fell, and through the shaken Veil came a voice: "Five hold the Veil. The sixth holds them."
