item.chaosshard.kael_blade.lore=He truly believed the light was on his side.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Act 4: Garrot duel, cutscenes
entity.chaosshard.garrot.name=Garrot
chaosshard.garrot.shadow=Garrot's Shadow
chaosshard.garrot.vassal=Garrot's Soldier
chaosshard.cutscene.skip=Space — skip
chaosshard.cutscene.grimoire=Grimoire
chaosshard.garrot.duel.warn=Drums. The ground shakes in time. Someone really wants a grand entrance.
chaosshard.garrot.duel.l1=So you're the one toppling the Pillars I couldn't scratch for three hundred years? ...I was saving them, of course. For myself.
chaosshard.garrot.duel.l2=This land is mine. I've been conquering it for three hundred years, and no Chaos creature will finish my work for me.
chaosshard.garrot.duel.l3=Translation: he's three hundred years late and very upset about it.
chaosshard.garrot.duel.l4=A duel! One on one, no pets. Win, and I bow. Lose, and you're a rug by my throne.
chaosshard.garrot.duel.l5=Accept. A Shard rug is a bad omen. For him.
chaosshard.garrot.duel.rules=One on one: servants stay out, the circle won't let you leave. When he raises his axe — step back or get behind him.
chaosshard.garrot.duel.alone=One on one — Garrot ignores anyone else's blows.
chaosshard.garrot.duel.ring=The duel circle won't let you out.
chaosshard.garrot.duel.cleave=Garrot raises his axe — step back or get behind him!
chaosshard.garrot.duel.phase2=Not bad! And this? A shadow doesn't strike the face — it strikes the back.
chaosshard.garrot.duel.phase3=Enough games! To me, shadows!
chaosshard.garrot.duel.yield1=Enough! ...Enough. I... bow. Temporarily. I mean, forever. As you wish.
chaosshard.garrot.duel.yield2=The Grim Army is yours. The banners too. Just never tell anyone how it went.
chaosshard.garrot.duel.yield3=Note: vassal. Three hundred years of experience, an army and an ego — free of charge.
chaosshard.garrot.duel.sworn=Garrot has bowed. No more raids, and his Banner on my Anchor means his soldiers in the garrison. The Thread grows stronger: +%s.
chaosshard.garrot.duel.won_by_him=Ha! Even a Chaos creature falls. Come back when you've learned. I'll wait — I'm good at it.
chaosshard.garrot.duel.fled=Fled the circle? I'll remember. Everyone will.
chaosshard.garrot.vassal.not_yet=The banner is Garrot's, not mine. For now.
chaosshard.garrot.vassal.came=Garrot's soldiers have joined the garrison: %s.
advancement.chaosshard.m.garrot_duel_start.title=Garrot Arrives
advancement.chaosshard.m.garrot_duel_start.desc=Quest milestone
advancement.chaosshard.m.garrot_duel.title=Garrot Has Bowed
advancement.chaosshard.m.garrot_duel.desc=Quest milestone
advancement.chaosshard.m.garrot_vassal.title=Vassals
advancement.chaosshard.m.garrot_vassal.desc=Quest milestone

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Act 4: Lightbearer scenes, Irena and monasteries
chaosshard.hero.kael.intro1=A Chaos creature at the Pillar? The people will sing of this day. Of me, naturally.
chaosshard.hero.kael.intro2=He doesn't know yet that I won't strike him from the front.
chaosshard.hero.irena.intro1=Child of Chaos... I will pray for you. Afterwards.
chaosshard.hero.irena.intro2=The monasteries heal her. While they burn, striking her is like bailing out the sea.
chaosshard.hero.irena.greet=The sisters are praying. The light will not abandon me.
chaosshard.hero.irena.phase2=Guards! Stand by the Pillar!
chaosshard.hero.irena.death=Kael... I'm coming...
chaosshard.hero.irena.lit=The monasteries heal her: %s of %s still burn. Put them out first.
chaosshard.hero.irena.memory=The second Pillar — and again the voice beyond the Veil: "The sixth is the Avatar of the World. The world's Soul made flesh. He has held the Veil for a thousand years and never tired."
chaosshard.omen.monastery=Irena's monastery: §e%s %s§d (%s blocks, %s). While it burns, she will not fall.
chaosshard.structure.monastery=Order Monastery
item.chaosshard.irena_rosary.name=Irena's Rosary
item.chaosshard.irena_rosary.desc=Shift+RMB on a block — place as a trophy: in the Lair servants and beasts near you slowly heal.
item.chaosshard.irena_rosary.lore=The beads are still warm. The prayer in them is not.
chaosshard.hero.irena.monastery_out=A monastery has gone dark. Still healing Irena: %s.
advancement.chaosshard.m.monastery_out.title=A Monastery Goes Dark
advancement.chaosshard.m.monastery_out.desc=Quest milestone

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Act 4: Velmor
tile.chaosshard.velmor_seal.name=Retreat Seal
chaosshard.structure.velmor_ward=Velmor's Retreat Seal
chaosshard.omen.wards=Velmor has hidden retreat seals around the Pillar: %s. The Omen won't say where. Better find them before the fight.
chaosshard.hero.velmor.intro1=A Chaos creature... I was expecting you, naturally. I always have a backup plan. And a backup for the backup.
chaosshard.hero.velmor.intro2=The backup plans are seals somewhere around. Better break them before he uses them.
chaosshard.hero.velmor.greet=Protective circuits in place. Let us begin.
chaosshard.hero.velmor.escape=Pardon me, I have an appointment elsewhere!
chaosshard.hero.velmor.no_seals=The seals?.. Where are my seals?!
chaosshard.hero.velmor.seal_here=Who dared touch my seals?!
chaosshard.hero.velmor.back=I'm back. As promised.
chaosshard.hero.velmor.death=There was... no backup plan...
chaosshard.hero.velmor.fled=Velmor fled to a seal: §e%s %s§d. While it holds, he can't be reached.
chaosshard.hero.velmor.warded=He's behind the seal's shield. Break the seal.
chaosshard.hero.velmor.seal_broken=A retreat seal is broken. Intact: %s, not yet found: %s.
chaosshard.hero.velmor.memory=The third: "The Veil is not a wall but a knot. Knots are untied in the Rift."
item.chaosshard.velmor_staff.name=Velmor's Staff
item.chaosshard.velmor_staff.desc=Shift+RMB on a block — place as a trophy: in the Lair Chaos energy regenerates 25% faster.
item.chaosshard.velmor_staff.lore=A backup plan that didn't save him.
advancement.chaosshard.m.seal_broken.title=Seal Broken
advancement.chaosshard.m.seal_broken.desc=Quest milestone

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Act 4: Lian and Elis
chaosshard.hero.lian.intro1=A Chaos creature! At last! Kael's ballad came out short — yours I'll sing longer.
chaosshard.hero.lian.intro2=While he sings, the guards grow fiercer. Blows break his song — many, and fast.
chaosshard.hero.lian.greet=Hear ye all! The song of the Chaos creature's last day!
chaosshard.hero.lian.phase2=Faster, faster — the finale is near!
chaosshard.hero.lian.death=Didn't... finish... the song...
chaosshard.hero.lian.song0=Lian sings the song of valor — break it with blows (%s damage needed)!
chaosshard.hero.lian.song1=Lian calls the choir — break the song with blows (%s damage needed)!
chaosshard.hero.lian.song2=Lian begins a lullaby — break it with blows (%s damage needed)!
chaosshard.hero.lian.sang0=Valor in every blade!
chaosshard.hero.lian.sang1=Choir, to me!
chaosshard.hero.lian.sang2=Sleep, creature... sleep...
chaosshard.hero.lian.silenced=Khh... my voice... my voice!
chaosshard.hero.lian.memory=The fourth: "The Avatar knows the Lord. The Lord remembers the Avatar. An old score."
chaosshard.hero.elis.intro1=Beyond lies the capital. Beyond, my father. Beyond — no one. Royal guard, to arms!
chaosshard.hero.elis.intro2=The last one. She strikes in dashes, and the royal guard stands behind her. While the guard lives, she can barely be hurt.
chaosshard.hero.elis.greet=For Luchezaria!
chaosshard.hero.elis.call1=Guards! To me!
chaosshard.hero.elis.call2=More! Everyone who can hold a sword!
chaosshard.hero.elis.call3=The last of you... to me...
chaosshard.hero.elis.death=Father... forgive me... the capital... is yours...
chaosshard.hero.elis.guarded=The royal guard shields her. The guard first.
chaosshard.hero.elis.royal=Royal Guard
chaosshard.hero.elis.memory=The fifth: "He waits in the Rift. He knows the name of the one who comes."
item.chaosshard.lian_lute.name=Lian's Lute
item.chaosshard.lian_lute.desc=Shift+RMB on a block — place as a trophy: in the Lair walking speed +10%.
item.chaosshard.lian_lute.lore=The strings remember the song of Kael. A short one.
item.chaosshard.elis_signet.name=Elis's Signet
item.chaosshard.elis_signet.desc=Shift+RMB on a block — place as a trophy: in the Lair villagers trade with you a quarter cheaper.
item.chaosshard.elis_signet.lore=The guard serves the ring, not the one who wears it.
