advancement.chaosshard.m.lian_silenced.desc=Quest milestone
advancement.chaosshard.m.act4_done.title=The Lightbearers Have Fallen
advancement.chaosshard.m.act4_done.desc=Quest milestone
chaosshard.act4.done=All five Pillars have fallen. The Veil is held by one — and he waits for me in the Rift. The road to the capital is open.
