# ---- Act 5: the Order's offensive
item.chaosshard.order_seal.name=Order Seal
chaosshard.order_seal.lore=Wax and gold: an Order captain's seal. Three seals point to the one who hands them out.
chaosshard.order.herald=Order Herald:
chaosshard.order.bannerman=Bearer of Light
chaosshard.order.rise=The Lightbearers have fallen and darkness stands at the gates. From now on the Order marches itself. Every land given to Chaos we shall burn with light.
chaosshard.order.raid.warn=The bells of the capital toll for you, creature. We are coming.
chaosshard.order.raid.start.0=For the King and the Light — forward!
chaosshard.order.raid.start.1=Banner forward! Let the Defilement burn beneath our feet!
chaosshard.order.raid.start.2=Not one step back. The Lightbearers are watching.
chaosshard.order.raid.fall.0=The captain has fallen… Fall back — to the capital!
chaosshard.order.raid.fall.1=The seal… take it, if you can carry it. The King is stronger still.
chaosshard.order.raid.fall.2=Retreat! The Light will return — with the dawn.
