chaosshard.crown.early=The Crown hides behind the Lightbearers. While one Pillar stands, the Omen is silent.
chaosshard.crown.already=The capital is already known: X %s, Z %s — %s blocks.
chaosshard.crown.found=The seals burned and showed the way. Capital of Luchezaria: X %s, Z %s — %s blocks. Walls, four towers with beacons, and a palace sealed by Light.
chaosshard.crown.beacon_guarded=The guards keep the light (%s nearby). Them first.
